            <ArticleTitle>[Risk of cancer associated with nutrition and physical inactivity].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>1113-7</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Due to the individual and socioeconomic burden of cancer, numerous studies have been performed to identify evitable causes. Some cancers could be avoided by nutritional prevention measures (practicing physical activity, limiting alcohol consumption, preventing overweight) in developed countries, including France.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
